<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round</p>
<p>results in the $475,000 men's Czech Open indoor tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 7-5</p>
<p>4-6 6-3</p>
<p>8-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-2 3-6 7-5</p>
<p>Joost Winnink (Netherlands) beat Michael Tabara (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 4-6 7-5</p>
<p>5-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat 4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>6-Michael Stich (Germany) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia) 7-6 (8-6) 6-2</p>
</text>
